\p \w In tithes|strong="H4643"\w* \w and offerings|strong="H8641"\w*. \v 9 \w You|strong="H859"\w* \w are cursed|strong="H779"\w* \w with a curse|strong="H3994"\w*, \w yet you|strong="H859"\w*— \w the whole|strong="H3605"\w* \w nation|strong="H1471"\w*— \w are still robbing Me|strong="H6906"\w*. \v 10 \w Bring|strong="H935"\w* \w the full|strong="H3605"\w* \w tithe|strong="H4643"\w* \w into|strong="H413"\w* \w the storehouse|strong="H1004"\w*, \w so that there may be|strong="H1961"\w* \w food|strong="H2964"\w* \w in My house|strong="H1004"\w*. \w Test Me|strong="H974"\w* \w in this|strong="H2063"\w*,” \w says|strong="H559"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*. “\w See if|strong="H518"\w* \w I will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w open|strong="H6605"\w* \w the windows|strong="H699"\w* \w of heaven|strong="H8064"\w* \w and pour out|strong="H7324"\w* for you \w blessing|strong="H1293"\w* \w without|strong="H1097"\w* \w measure|strong="H1767"\w*.\f + \fr 3:10 \ft Literally \fqa blessing for which there will be no room\f* \v 11 \w I will rebuke|strong="H1605"\w* \w the devourer|strong="H398"\w*\f + \fr 3:11 \fqa The devourer \ft is probably a name for a crop-destroying pest.\f* for you, \w so that it will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w destroy|strong="H7843"\w* \w the fruits|strong="H6529"\w* \w of your land|strong="H127"\w*, \w and the vine|strong="H1612"\w* \w in your field|strong="H7704"\w* \w will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w fail to produce fruit|strong="H7921"\w*,” \w says|strong="H559"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H6635"\w*.
